    "['port vlan-stacking vlan [parameter1] stack-vlan [parameter2]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/1 unit 0 family ethernet-switching vlan members 10', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/1 unit 0 family ethernet-switching vlan members 10\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/1 unit 0 family ethernet-switching vlan rewrite translate 10 100\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\nThe Huawei `port vlan-stacking vlan 10 stack-vlan 100` command performs VLAN stacking (QinQ) where VLAN 10 is tagged and then encapsulated within VLAN 100. In Juniper, this is achieved by:\\n1. First setting the interface to accept VLAN 10 traffic\\n2. Then configuring VLAN translation to rewrite/encapsulate VLAN 10 as VLAN 100\\n\\nNote: The exact Junos syntax might vary slightly depending on the platform and software version. Some Juniper devices might use `vlan-tags` instead of `vlan rewrite translate`.', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/1 unit 0 family ethernet-switching vlan members 10'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/1 unit 0 family ethernet-switching vlan rewrite translate 10 100', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/1 unit 0 family ethernet-switching vlan members 10\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/1 unit 0 family ethernet-switching vlan rewrite translate 10 100\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\nThe Huawei `port vlan-stacking vlan 10 stack-vlan 100` command performs VLAN stacking (QinQ) where VLAN 10 is tagged and then encapsulated within VLAN 100. In Juniper, this is achieved by:\\n1. First setting the interface to accept VLAN 10 traffic\\n2. Then configuring VLAN translation to rewrite/encapsulate VLAN 10 as VLAN 100\\n\\nNote: The exact Junos syntax might vary slightly depending on the platform and software version. Some Juniper devices might use `vlan-tags` instead of `vlan rewrite translate`.', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/1 unit 0 family ethernet-switching vlan rewrite translate 10 100'}]]": 1,
    "['port vlan-stacking vlan [parameter1] stack-vlan [parameter2]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/2 flexible-vlan-tagging', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent Juniper JUNOS configuration for the Huawei VLAN stacking command:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 flexible-vlan-tagging\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 encapsulation flexible-ethernet-services\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 unit 0 vlan-tags outer 20 inner 100\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. Enables flexible VLAN tagging on the interface\\n2. Sets the encapsulation type to support VLAN stacking\\n3. Configures the VLAN stacking with outer VLAN 20 and inner VLAN 100 (Q-in-Q tunneling)\\n\\nNote: In Juniper, this is typically referred to as \"Q-in-Q\" or \"double-tagged VLAN\" configuration rather than \"VLAN stacking.\" The functionality is equivalent, tagging an inner VLAN (100) within an outer VLAN (20).', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/2 flexible-vlan-tagging'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/2 encapsulation flexible-ethernet-services', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent Juniper JUNOS configuration for the Huawei VLAN stacking command:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 flexible-vlan-tagging\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 encapsulation flexible-ethernet-services\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 unit 0 vlan-tags outer 20 inner 100\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. Enables flexible VLAN tagging on the interface\\n2. Sets the encapsulation type to support VLAN stacking\\n3. Configures the VLAN stacking with outer VLAN 20 and inner VLAN 100 (Q-in-Q tunneling)\\n\\nNote: In Juniper, this is typically referred to as \"Q-in-Q\" or \"double-tagged VLAN\" configuration rather than \"VLAN stacking.\" The functionality is equivalent, tagging an inner VLAN (100) within an outer VLAN (20).', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/2 encapsulation flexible-ethernet-services'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/2 unit 0 vlan-tags outer 20 inner 100', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent Juniper JUNOS configuration for the Huawei VLAN stacking command:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 flexible-vlan-tagging\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 encapsulation flexible-ethernet-services\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 unit 0 vlan-tags outer 20 inner 100\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. Enables flexible VLAN tagging on the interface\\n2. Sets the encapsulation type to support VLAN stacking\\n3. Configures the VLAN stacking with outer VLAN 20 and inner VLAN 100 (Q-in-Q tunneling)\\n\\nNote: In Juniper, this is typically referred to as \"Q-in-Q\" or \"double-tagged VLAN\" configuration rather than \"VLAN stacking.\" The functionality is equivalent, tagging an inner VLAN (100) within an outer VLAN (20).', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/2 unit 0 vlan-tags outer 20 inner 100'}]]": 1,
